{"id":8906378074,"name":"[🥳BACK]  Half Life: City 8","desc":"[ℝℙ/𝕋𝔻𝕄] Half-Life, City-08.\n\nWith the surrender of humanity in the Seven Hour War, you must survive in the remains of Tokyo, now known as City 8 under the Combine's control. After an incident involving a rebel known as Alyx taking down the Combine Vault in City-17, the combine has began to strengthen it's grip on humanity within all Urban Centers.\n\nWill you:\n> Pledge to the Combine as a Loyalist?\n> Serve as part of Civil Protection?\n> Rebel against the Combine's oppression?\n\nYou decide your own fate within City-08.\n\n⭐ Join the City-8 Community Group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/13426157/Click-Here \n📌 EXP Doesn't Save In Private Servers\n\nTags: Half Life, Combine, City-17, City-24, Industrial-17, City-8, Half Life Roleplay, Seven Hour War, Headcrab, Headcrab Infection, Half Life 2, RP, Roleplay, TDM, Garry's Mod, Sci-Fi, Dystopian","path":"/game/8906378074-half-life-city-8","slug":"8906378074-half-life-city-8","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f3f4697ad134f7727883981eb6c8bf83e9151896da4687f5724208ca83846331.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-914c1deb6e4c77c279f3790f0f257d1b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":36,"visitor":13375987,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-15T12:47:58.520Z","creator":{"name":"Half-Life World","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"689f2c7ef2b3a9bab0cf2de2","title":"Kill All  Item Spawn  etc Teleports","game":{"_id":"689f2c7ef2b3a9bab0cf2ddf","gameId":8906378074,"name":"[🥳BACK]  Half Life: City 8","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"8906378074-half-life-city-8","path":"/game/8906378074-half-life-city-8","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8906378074},"slug":"BACK-Half-Life:-City-8-Kill-All-Item-Spawn-etc-Teleports-48643","verified":false,"k